    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71026" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>convert into pure Intelligence,</i> in 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοῦς γενομένη [ἡ ψυχὴ] αὐτὴ θεωρεῖ
					οἷον νοωθεῖσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					6.7.35
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
